    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the galaxy in search of planets rich in ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and dig into the ground for valuable ores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforms the planet and collects ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell ores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that the company takes 30% of your earnings but that's the price you pay to return to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy new equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack, radar, sand vacuum, icebreaker, etc. Everything needed to optimize ore extraction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the galaxy in search of planets rich in ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and dig into the ground for valuable ores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforms the planet and collects ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell ores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that the company takes 30% of your earnings but that's the price you pay to return to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy new equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack, radar, sand vacuum, icebreaker, etc. Everything needed to optimize ore extraction.</p>",
